{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Would you risk everything for the sake of a video?&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends run a YouTube channel dedicated to exploring supernatural phenomena. With each video, you get closer to a deeper, more frightening reality. This time, the place you visit is different from the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, everything seems like a routine shoot. But as time passes, the atmosphere changes. The things you see or don\u2019t see begin to follow you.<br>You're no longer just creating content. You're fighting to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Camera Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness all events in the game through the camera in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854410/extras/c7a3fb3926fadf3769343b31678e8922.poster.avif?t=1768336475\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854410/extras/c7a3fb3926fadf3769343b31678e8922.webm?t=1768336475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854410/extras/c7a3fb3926fadf3769343b31678e8922.mp4?t=1768336475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environment-Based Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Carefully examine objects around you to solve the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854410/extras/fdf677c795196e05ee3de995f10c78a9.poster.avif?t=1768336475\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854410/extras/fdf677c795196e05ee3de995f10c78a9.webm?t=1768336475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854410/extras/fdf677c795196e05ee3de995f10c78a9.mp4?t=1768336475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Suspense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, run, hide, but always watch your back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854410/extras/8c7dc75d85a2325d407a40743f2ea6e4.poster.avif?t=1768336475\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854410/extras/8c7dc75d85a2325d407a40743f2ea6e4.webm?t=1768336475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854410/extras/8c7dc75d85a2325d407a40743f2ea6e4.mp4?t=1768336475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-Quality Sound Design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of Puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Are We Recording?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854410/a4d03af3244c2f8514fdbc8e042ef3372d963e85.jpg"},{"name":"Unexpected Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps